  chart_extract [
    label="1. Chart Extraction (261019_17h33m07s_screenshot.png)\nXRPUSDT · 1H · Aster · O1.3049 H1.3107 L1.3011 C1.3016 (2026-10-19T15:33:07Z)\n164 hourly candles extracted (2026-10-12T20:00Z to 2026-10-19T15:00Z)\n• Macro Lower Highs: 1.3860 (Oct 14) → 1.3530 (Oct 16) → 1.3120 (Oct 17) → 1.3212 (Oct 19 07:00Z)\n• Macro Lower Lows: 1.3108 (Oct 13) → 1.2832 (Oct 15) → 1.2691 (Oct 17) → 1.2551 (Oct 18 19:00Z)\n• V-bounce 1.2551 → 1.3212 (+5.27%) stalled at 0.500 macro Fib (1.3205) & Oct 16 shelf (1.3231)\n• Oct 19 9h upper shelf (1.3082–1.3169) broke down at 10:00Z to 1.2987\n• 4 lower-high rejections under broken shelf: 1.3120 (12:00Z) → 1.3146 (13:00Z) → 1.3133 (14:00Z) → 1.3107 (15:00Z)\n• Bounce Fibs (1.2551→1.3212): 0.236=1.3056, 0.382=1.2959, 0.500=1.2881, 0.618=1.2804, 0.786=1.2692\n• 1H Wilder ATR-14 = 0.0100 (0.76%), RSI-14 = 49.85, SMA-20 = 1.3040, SMA-50 = 1.2958, SMA-100 = 1.3082",
