    label="2. Scenario Generation & Jev Exhaustion Loop\n• Initial S1–S5 → Jev noul another_plausible p=0.64 (>=0.60, opposite p=0.39) → CONTINUE\n• Added S6 (bull trap 1.3320–1.3360) & S7 (bear trap 1.2691–1.2804) → Jev noul another_plausible p=0.57 (<0.60, opposite p=0.43) → STOP\n\nJev Rerank (7 Scenarios across Chart + Research):\n1. S1_short_bounce_1308_1314_to_1282 (relevance=0.97) [SELECTED]\n2. S4_range_chop_1288_1316_no_trade (relevance=0.96)\n3. S2_long_pullback_1288_1295_to_1321 (relevance=0.95)\n4. S6_bull_trap_sweep_1321_1336_then_drop (relevance=0.95)\n5. S3_short_immediate_breakdown_to_1269_1255 (relevance=0.94)\n6. S7_deep_sweep_1269_1280_then_bounce (relevance=0.94)\n7. S5_long_immediate_breakout_to_1345_1353 (relevance=0.92)",
